Windows installer: the "open office documents with HST Office" box starts ticked

Owner decision for 1.0.0: interactive installs offer HST Office as the default app with the box
ticked. Only the switch from hst-msi-default-apps-checkbox.patch changes; silent installs and the
updater still change nothing unless HSTDEFAULTAPPS=1 is passed.

--- a/instsetoo_native/inc_openoffice/windows/msi_templates/Property.idt
+++ b/instsetoo_native/inc_openoffice/windows/msi_templates/Property.idt
@@ -66,3 +66,3 @@
 WinMajorVerMin	WINMAJORVERMINTEMPLATE
 REGISTER_PDF	1
-HSTDEFAULTAPPSUI	0
+HSTDEFAULTAPPSUI	1
